## What works

- Responsive dashboard and subject/topic form
- English and Filipino generation options
- Beginner, Intermediate, and Advanced levels
- AI-generated lesson explanations, definitions, concepts, examples, and summary
- Click-to-flip flashcards with previous/next controls
- Multiple-choice quiz, answer checking, explanations, and final score
- Loading and error messages
- API key kept on the server

Generated content depends on the AI model and should be checked against trusted class materials.
